      }
    },
    "Diagnostics": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "起動診断"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show real hands too (to check alignment with the game's hands)": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "現実の手も表示する（ゲームの手との位置合わせ確認用）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Starting…": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "起動中…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Start stereo VR": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ステレオVRを開始"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Stop": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "停止"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The immersive VR view is already open. Press the Digital Crown to close it, then start again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没入VRはすでに開いています。Digital Crownで終了してから再度開始してください。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Immersive VR is showing. See “Receive fps” and “Render fps” for the video state.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没入VRを表示中です。映像の状態は「受信fps」「描画fps」で確認できます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The VR view was cancelled.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "VR表示がキャンセルされました。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The VR view state is unknown.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "VR表示の状態を取得できません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "visionOS could not open the space. If another immersive app is open, close it with the Digital Crown and try again. The Diagnostics row shows the compositor state.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "visionOSが空間を開けませんでした。別の没入アプリが開いていればDigital Crownで終了してから再試行してください。診断欄にCompositorの状態を表示します。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Joy-Con (recommended): pair both Joy-Con in visionOS Settings > Bluetooth, then press L and R on both at the same time to merge them into one controller. Hand tracking supplies the hand positions; the Joy-Con supply the buttons. ZL/ZR = trigger, L/R = grip (grab), sticks (with click), right A/B = A, right X/Y = B, left ↓/← = X, left ↑/→ = Y, −/+ = menu. Without Joy-Con, gestures control the game: thumb+index pinch = trigger, curl three fingers = grip, thumb+ring = A/X, thumb+little = B/Y, thumb+middle pinch and move the hand = stick.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ジョイコン（推奨）: Vision Proの「設定 > Bluetooth」で左右のジョイコンをペアリングし、左右のL・Rボタンを同時に押して1つのコントローラーにまとめます。手の位置はハンドトラッキング、ボタンはジョイコンです。ZL/ZR＝トリガー、L/R＝グリップ（つかむ）、スティック（押し込みあり）、右のA・B＝A、右のX・Y＝B、左の↓・←＝X、左の↑・→＝Y、−/＋＝メニュー。ジョイコンがないときはジェスチャー操作: 親指と人差し指でトリガー、3本指を握るとグリップ、親指と薬指でA/X、親指と小指でB/Y、親指と中指でつまんだまま手を動かすとスティック。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "One-handed gamepad hold": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "片手持ちゲームパッドの向き"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Upright": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "縦持ち"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turned left": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "左に倒す"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Turned right": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "右に倒す"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "one-handed in the left hand; the right hand uses gestures for trigger and grip": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "左手で片手持ち。右手はジェスチャーでトリガーとグリップ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "merged pair, sensors on the right hand": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "左右をまとめたペア。センサーは右手"
          }
        }
